go-nmsg (0.4.0) debian-fsi; urgency=medium

  * Port ZeroMQ support from libxs (crossroads.io) to libzmq (pebbe/zmq4).
  * Add Close() method to Input and Output interfaces.
  * Fix zlib bomb and container length integer overflow vulnerabilities.
  * Guard against overflow in zmq_io.Read().
  * Use zmq_ctx_new()/zmq_ctx_term() API; clean up ZMQ context at shutdown.
  * Update go module dependencies.
  * Test suite improvements.

 -- DomainTools LLC <software@domaintools.com>  Mon, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

go-nmsg (0.3.0-1) debian-fsi; urgency=medium

  * Add support for dnsobs message type.

  * Add facilities for translating vendor and message type names to and from
    numeric ids.

  * Fix bug leading to unnecessary fragmentation of NMSG containers.

 -- Farsight Security, Inc. <software@farsightsecurity.com>  Wed, 27 Sep 2023 18:07:00 +0000

